# Dev Notes 59 — Runtime Event Log Store Contract v1

**Date:** 2026-06-20  
**Branch:** `runtime-event-log-store-contract-v1`  
**Repo:** `Main-Michael-Sparks/runtime-dev-repo`  
**Status:** Merged/uploaded to `main` and main-inspected for the declared contract-only event-log store seam. Assistant syntax checks, fixture coverage, worker import hygiene, targeted event-log contract smoke, related action-event/execute-action mock regression smokes, package extraction/recheck, artifact guard, Michael local Windows/MINGW64 real-runtime execute-action/nativeWorkerBackend/cancelAction spot checks, direct GitHub branch inspection, and direct GitHub `main` inspection passed. No real-runtime test was required for this contract-only scope, but Michael completed the extra real-runtime confidence pass and it passed.

---

## 1. Purpose

This branch adds a narrow, modular contract seam for future durable action-event/audit storage.

The branch answers:

```text
what an event-log store adapter must expose
what append/read entry shapes are legal
what cursor fields are legal
what event types are default durable-log candidates
how high-volume action.stream.delta is excluded by default
```

This branch intentionally does **not** implement runtime persistence, a durable database/file backend, process-restart recovery, cross-process pub/sub, stream-delta retention, stream-delta replay, graph runtime behavior, or Runtime Memory Module storage.

---

## 2. Modular ownership boundaries

The event surface remains split across focused modules:

```text
runtime/bus/actionEvent.mjs
  validation and normalization of action-event envelopes only

runtime/bus/actionEventHistory.mjs
  bounded retained in-memory history/readback only

runtime/bus/actionEventSubscriptionRegistry.mjs
  live same-process listener registry/filtering/publication only

runtime/bus/actionEventReplay.mjs
  optional retained in-memory replay/live-join orchestration only

runtime/bus/actionStreamDeltaEvents.mjs
  live-only action.stream.delta mapping from injected parent-side stream observations only

runtime/bus/actionEventLog/*
  contract-only future durable event-log adapter shape, append/read validation, cursor/result shape validation, and high-volume event policy
```

No broad event manager was introduced.

The new event-log contract modules do not import:

```text
runtime.mjs
workerBridge.mjs
llama_worker/**
runtime/request/**
runtime/stream/**
runtime/lifecycle/**
runtime/backends/**
actionEventHistory.mjs
actionEventReplay.mjs
actionEventSubscriptionRegistry.mjs
actionStreamDeltaEvents.mjs
```

