## 12. Recommended next step

Recommended next branch family, if continuing this line, is a separate plan/spec rather than immediate implementation:

```text
runtime-event-log-store-integration-plan-spec
```

That future plan/spec should decide append failure policy, buffering/retry behavior, adapter lifecycle, whether action execution can fail due to durable append failure, and how the event-log contract integrates with existing live subscription/history/replay surfaces without creating a broad event manager.

Do not begin storage backend implementation, cross-process pub/sub, retained stream-delta history, stream-delta replay, Runtime Memory Module implementation, or Cognitive Graph Runtime work without a separate reviewed plan/spec.
